  "text": "Light dashboards feel good: taps, live updates, opening a view and more-info dialogs are quick, and scrolling is fluid. Bigger dashboards slow down: typical without a camera blocks for 2.7 s after it is drawn, and heavy takes 1.5 s to show a change and doesn't open a more-info dialog fully. The likely limit is the browser's main thread: it stays busy (82% of a core on typical with a camera playing), and the page draws too few frames. Memory isn't the limit (964 of 988 MB).",
